      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport from Pune</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When planning a long-distance relocation from Pune to Ahmedabad, the success of your move depends as much on administrative accuracy as it does on physical logistics. Pune-based packers and movers operating on this high-volume inter-state corridor operate under strict regulatory and safety protocols.</p>
<p>To ensure a seamless handover and avoid customs or state-border delays, you must prepare a specific set of essential documents before the loading process begins. These papers serve as the legal backbone of your shipment, protecting both your assets and the service provider.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The foundational requirement is the <strong>self-attested RC photocopy</strong> of your vehicle.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Since this is an inter-state move crossing from Maharashtra to Gujarat, the movers must verify the registered owner of the vehicle transporting your goods, or your residence details if the vehicle is a hired truck.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This document is critical for navigating state check-points and ensuring compliance with local transport laws.</span></li></ul>
<p>Alongside this, you must provide a <strong>current PUC (Pollution Under Control) certificate</strong>. Transport authorities in both Pune and Ahmedabad strictly enforce environmental standards, and a valid PUC ensures that the transport vehicle is legally permitted to operate on the highway, preventing any unexpected impoundments or fines that could delay your delivery.</p>

<p>Beyond vehicle compliance, the integrity of your cargo is protected through formal documentation. You will require a <strong>valid insurance certificate</strong> issued by the moving company. It is imperative that you insist on <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Unlike basic coverage, which may only offer a fraction of the replacement cost, declared-value insurance guarantees that if any item is damaged, lost, or stolen during the transit from Pune to Ahmedabad, you receive compensation equal to the full market value of the item.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This provides total financial protection against the inherent risks of a 600+ kilometer journey.</span></li></ul>

<p>Finally, the most critical operational document is the <strong>IBA-approved consignment bilty</strong>. This bill of lading is the official receipt and contract of carriage. An IBA (Indian Brokers Association) approved bilty signifies that the moving company is licensed and part of a recognized industry body. The bilty must list every single box, item, and its condition.</p>
<p>Both you and the mover must sign this document. It serves as the primary evidence for any future claims and ensures accountability throughout the entire journey. Without these four specific documents, a professional moving company in Pune should refuse to proceed with your shipment.</p></div>
